    "label": "02 ESP32 Andon + OEE",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Andon tower and OEE dashboard for firmware/esp32_machine_control.\nBase topic: lab/line1/m2\nSet SIMULATE_DEVICE=true to run a virtual machine with the same topics and OEE math."
